Org profile README repo, plus one composite action (actions/claude-review) that is
SHA-pinned by every consumer. There is no build, no lint and no new-user walk.

There IS a test surface, and it is not optional: actions/claude-review/test/ holds a
response-shape harness and a mutant suite. Run BOTH before pushing any change to
action.yml, and require every mutant to be caught:

  python3 actions/claude-review/test/harness.py actions/claude-review/action.yml
  python3 actions/claude-review/test/mutants.py actions/claude-review/action.yml \
          actions/claude-review/test/harness.py

A green harness proves nothing on its own -- a harness that asserts the wrong things
passes just as green as one that works. The mutant run is the non-vacuity control.
